
  THE THREE SOLUTIONS: sigma(n) = 2n + phi(n)

======================================================================

  Computing sigma and phi up to 10,000,000...

  Solutions to sigma(n) = 2n + phi(n) for n <= 10000000:

  n =         12 = 2^2 * 3
