  Total solutions up to 10000000: 4

  STRUCTURAL ANALYSIS
  --------------------------------------------------

  All solutions divisible by 6?
    12 / 6 = 2.0, mod 6 = 0
    42 / 6 = 7.0, mod 6 = 0
    1242 / 6 = 207.0, mod 6 = 0
    6137440 / 6 = 1022906.6666666666, mod 6 = 4

  The equation in terms of local factors:
  Let f(p,a) = (p^{a+1}-1)/((p-1)*p^a)  [local sigma/n factor]
  Let g(p) = (p-1)/p = 1-1/p             [local phi/n factor]
  Then: prod f(p_i,a_i) = 2 + prod g(p_i)

    p=2, a=2: f(p,a)=7/4 = 1.750000, g(p)=1/2
    p=3, a=1: f(p,a)=4/3 = 1.333333, g(p)=2/3
    prod f = 7/3 = 2.333333
    prod g = 1/3 = 0.333333
    2 + prod g = 7/3 = 2.333333
    Equal? True

    p=2, a=1: f(p,a)=3/2 = 1.500000, g(p)=1/2
    p=3, a=1: f(p,a)=4/3 = 1.333333, g(p)=2/3
    p=7, a=1: f(p,a)=8/7 = 1.142857, g(p)=6/7
    prod f = 16/7 = 2.285714
    prod g = 2/7 = 0.285714
    2 + prod g = 16/7 = 2.285714
    Equal? True

    p=2, a=1: f(p,a)=3/2 = 1.500000, g(p)=1/2
    p=3, a=3: f(p,a)=40/27 = 1.481481, g(p)=2/3
    p=23, a=1: f(p,a)=24/23 = 1.043478, g(p)=22/23
    prod f = 160/69 = 2.318841
    prod g = 22/69 = 0.318841
    2 + prod g = 160/69 = 2.318841
    Equal? True

    p=2, a=5: f(p,a)=63/32 = 1.968750, g(p)=1/2
    p=5, a=1: f(p,a)=6/5 = 1.200000, g(p)=4/5
    p=89, a=1: f(p,a)=90/89 = 1.011236, g(p)=88/89
    p=431, a=1: f(p,a)=432/431 = 1.002320, g(p)=430/431
    prod f = 91854/38359 = 2.394588
    prod g = 15136/38359 = 0.394588
    2 + prod g = 91854/38359 = 2.394588
    Equal? True

